            "review_title": "Review at Bun Cha Hanoi - Tay Ho Quan",
            "review_text": "Binh Nguyen\n13 contributions\n0\nBun Cha - My favourite food\nDec 2023\nI have visited this restaurant for a lot of times, like since 2018.\nNo matter how many times I come here, Bun Cha almost stays the same taste just like last times. It' s always delicious, specially the roasted meat and the broth. \n\nI have tried several Bun Cha restaurants around Danang City, but only this restaurant suits my taste (I think I like the broth the most). This is the best Bun Cha restaurant up to this point, in my opinion.\n\nBig recommendation for this restaurant if whenever you want to eat alone or with friends. I definitely visit next time when I have a chance.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 11, 2024",
